{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"X\",\n    \"small\": \"X\",\n    \"core\": \"X\",\n    \"concise\": \"X\",\n    \"human\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\",\n    \"load\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big/core：X的大字能直接串出离开是为了不再受委屈、却始终舍不得旧日归属、最终不愿为亲近而放弃尊严的主线；Y虽然信息完整，但大量使用“落点、支撑、方向、承担”等抽象概念，人物具体经历和核心冲突不够鲜明。small/fine：X的小字更常补出大字没有表达的具体矛盾和体验，例如“外头像给众人看的舞步，心里却只哼自己的旧歌”“不是记忆变坏了，是它太好了”；Y有些感受只是把大字换一种说法重复一遍。concise/load：X的重点短语较短，意群切分清楚，跨屏重复也更多带来情节推进；Y同屏大块偏多偏长，亲近、距离、离开等概念反复解释，扫读负担更重。human：Y有“成了实际的位置变化”“不再把彻底释怀当成离开完成的条件”“继续承担这段离开”等明显书面化、抽象化表达，X的“心里空落落的”“跟自己争得没了力气”“带着想念继续过日子”等更符合日常说话习惯。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d329ecee-cf48-4eb5-b2f0-8096b79ceaa9", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261111T150744799870Z", "elapsed_seconds": 134.859, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T15:09:59.662830+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "01c7b69569e0bc4f791fd0c21238e90a50af40cca8adfd1b44e6844af2416120", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6b